                "text": "Not all battle scars are visible. Far too often, our servicemen and women suffer silently from mental health challenges following their service. That\u2019s why I joined @RepSelf\u2019s resolution to declare September 22nd as National Military & Veterans Suicide Awareness Day - an important step to break the stigma and raise awareness of the many resources and support available for our troops.",
