                "text": "Today, World Suicide Prevention Day, serves as a reminder that you are never alone. Together, we can break the stigma, raise awareness, and spread hope. If you or someone you know is experiencing a mental health crisis or needs help, call or text 988. https://t.co/whHYjYEvIf",
